-- ECHO — expected function inventory (checked-in; the X-5 CI diff source).
-- One row per sync function: (schema, proname, security_definer, owner,
-- execute_grantees, search_path). The database view
-- public.v_sync_function_inventory must equal this set EXACTLY — any
-- function present but absent here, or drifted on any attribute, fails CI.
--
-- Owner expectation: the migration role (`postgres` on hosted Supabase and
-- the CI/local environments — the documented platform behavior, PATCH1
-- §3.3.7 Option B).
--
-- format: schema|proname|security_definer|owner|execute_grantees|search_path

public|sync_init_profile|f|postgres|authenticated|search_path=pg_catalog, echo_data, auth
